  "duration": 165.7173125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.74,
      "text": "Before you know it, you'll be finishing school and starting your career."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.26,
      "end": 9.34,
      "text": "Familiar job titles like entrepreneur, teacher, lawyer, or designer will still exist,"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.46,
      "end": 12.54,
      "text": "but the daily reality of those roles is already changing."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.46,
      "end": 17.7,
      "text": "If everyone has access to these tools and gets similarly capable answers from the AI,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.36,
      "end": 20.34,
      "text": "what sets you apart from anyone else?"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.08,
      "end": 22.88,
      "text": "The answer is what you already know."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.42,
      "end": 26.5,
      "text": "Let's look at how this plays out in a real, entry-level scenario."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.04,
      "end": 28.94,
      "text": "This image lays out your first assignment."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.94,
      "end": 33.18,
      "text": "Your manager tells you we're getting bad customer feedback on our new product."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.56,
      "end": 37.56,
      "text": "Read the last 500 reviews and tell us what's happening and how we should fix it."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.92,
      "end": 42.46,
      "text": "In the old job, before AI, the entire week disappears into the first pass."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.14,
      "end": 45.8,
      "text": "Now let's look at the new job, with AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.48,
      "end": 49.54,
      "text": "The AI completes that entire first pass in minutes."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.12,
      "end": 55.16,
      "text": "The AI reads the reviews, finds the themes, builds the spreadsheet and drafts the deck."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.16,
      "end": 60.78,
      "text": "work. You start your work by improving what the AI produced. You spend your time investigating"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.78,
      "end": 66.3,
      "text": "the why, recommending a fix, and presenting findings. Because the mechanical labor is"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.3,
      "end": 71.62,
      "text": "out of the way, your work week begins immediately with the real questions. But improving"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.62,
      "end": 74.94,
      "text": "and contextualizing that work requires what you already know."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.52,
      "end": 79.98,
      "text": "As you navigate these new workflows, you'll hear two specific terms used to categorize"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.98,
      "end": 82.1,
      "text": "how these tools handle professional tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.76,
      "end": 84.56,
      "text": "This graphic shows the distinction clearly."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.3,
      "end": 86.8,
      "text": "On the left, we have automate."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.44,
      "end": 90.32,
      "text": "This is when the AI fully takes over a mechanical step,"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.6,
      "end": 93.0,
      "text": "like sorting the reviews, grouping the ideas,"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.02,
      "end": 95.14,
      "text": "and creating that first baseline summary."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.64,
      "end": 96.9,
      "text": "On the right is augment."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.6,
      "end": 100.8,
      "text": "Here, the AI acts as a tool to expand what you can do."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.34,
      "end": 103.4,
      "text": "It helps you explore more explanations,"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.92,
      "end": 104.86,
      "text": "compare more options,"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.86,
      "end": 107.5,
      "text": "and ultimately improve your final recommendation."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.28,
      "end": 109.86,
      "text": "But beneath both of these methods,"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.86,
      "end": 112.34,
      "text": "lies a non-negotiable rule of modern work."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.84,
      "end": 114.58,
      "text": "The work still has your name on it."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.96,
      "end": 115.92,
      "text": "You own the outcome."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.96,
      "end": 119.12,
      "text": "Historically, grunt work, like basic research"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.12,
      "end": 121.68,
      "text": "and starter code or simple data analysis,"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.12,
      "end": 123.86,
      "text": "was the primary way young professionals"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.86,
      "end": 125.24,
      "text": "actually learned their trade."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.92,
      "end": 128.5,
      "text": "Now, the AI handles a lot of that initial labor."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.2,
      "end": 131.3,
      "text": "Because of this, you face a strange paradox."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.06,
      "end": 133.24,
      "text": "AI can make you productive"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.24,
      "end": 134.68,
      "text": "before it makes you knowledgeable."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.54,
      "end": 136.98,
      "text": "This creates a subtle trap."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.5,
      "end": 138.3,
      "text": "In your early career,"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.3,
      "end": 142.92,
      "text": "you will likely be asked to verify and approve highly sophisticated outputs from the AI,"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.34,
      "end": 147.18,
      "text": "long before you have built the underlying expertise required to spot its errors."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.9,
      "end": 150.78,
      "text": "Your only defense against this trap is relentless learning."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.28,
      "end": 153.16,
      "text": "You have to build that expertise yourself,"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.58,
      "end": 157.3,
      "text": "making your time in school right now the greatest advantage you could possibly have."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.08,
      "end": 159.7,
      "text": "AI is changing the work you'll do."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.18,
      "end": 161.42,
      "text": "Now it's on you to learn."
    }
  ],
